8kloud-switcher (0.6.5) resolute; urgency=medium

  * First Debian package. Targets Ubuntu Server 26.04 with the NVIDIA driver,
    CUDA toolkit headers and Qt 6.
  * Links and ships an LGPL-2.1+ FFmpeg built by
    packaging/build-ffmpeg-lgpl.sh rather than the distribution's
    GPL-configured one, alongside the OMT runtime, in a private libdir.
  * Relicensed to MPL-2.0.

 -- Devin Block <devin@devinblock.com>  Mon, 10 Aug 2026 23:30:00 +0000
